Building bridges through international education. 🌎

The Crescent team led by Mr.Abdul Qadir, Pro Chancellor, BSACIST, and Chairman, CIIC and AIC-CIIC, connected with Ms.Lorie Johns Páulez, Director of Education Abroad, Office of International Education, https://t.co/uqG0E6xOKp, Georgia Institute of Technology, during their visit.

The interaction brought the conversation towards international education, global academic exposure and the role of cross-border experiences in connecting students, institutions and learning environments.

For an institution working at the intersection of academia, innovation and entrepreneurship, such engagements offer a broader perspective on how global exposure can complement institutional development and create new avenues for knowledge exchange.

The conversation added another dimension to the Crescent team’s engagements at Georgia Tech — looking beyond innovation programmes to the international academic networks and experiences that connect institutions across borders.

Global learning begins with meaningful connections.

